    "CommandTraceDriver": {
      "action": "add",
      "docs": "Primary adapter that locally records one already-completed command. Its usecase dependency retains the typed Result<(), CommandTraceWriteError> boundary. The driver consumes that typed result and always returns CommandOutcome: a trace-write failure is rendered into stderr without changing the completed command's stdout or original exit_code, so tracing failure remains visible without replacing the command's behavioral result or leaking infrastructure types.",
